WEBVTT

00:33.240 --> 00:34.680
It felt like someone tried to lift up my skirt.

00:34.680 --> 00:35.630
It's no good...

00:35.630 --> 00:39.930
I can't count the thousands of pornos
I've written that originated in panty shots.

00:40.610 --> 00:43.850
No! I must find some new inspiration!

00:46.850 --> 00:49.100
Is your draft done?

00:49.100 --> 00:50.860
Ch-Chief!

00:50.880 --> 00:54.080
Um, well... N-Not yet.

00:54.080 --> 00:55.860
My phone!

00:55.860 --> 00:58.860
Yes? Right now.

01:00.100 --> 01:01.650
No, I understand.

01:01.650 --> 01:03.370
Yes, I won't miss more deadlines.

01:03.830 --> 01:06.010
Yes... Yes, I'll do my best!

01:08.850 --> 01:11.340
Are you in some kind of slump?

01:13.120 --> 01:14.240
Yes...

01:25.060 --> 01:27.850
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

01:36.400 --> 01:41.450
These fifteen secrets in my head are written in letters, tucked away in my uniform.

01:41.450 --> 01:47.040
When you keep on making circles around me, in the middle of the launch of your image,

01:47.870 --> 01:52.590
you treat me kindly even with your mean look and puffed cheeks.

01:52.590 --> 01:58.260
For your first heart-throbbing, I'm sure you'll find it tremendous!

01:58.800 --> 02:01.720
Your voice will escape daringly!

02:01.720 --> 02:04.600
What you want to make your heart tingle, tell me!

02:04.600 --> 02:07.520
Quick! Let me! Where do you want what?! Seriously, you're terrible!

02:07.520 --> 02:09.520
These wild ideas have all detonated!

02:09.520 --> 02:12.360
I want to try and swallow more

02:12.360 --> 02:15.530
I want you to pet me more

02:15.530 --> 02:18.360
What kind of flavor is your heart?

02:18.360 --> 02:21.240
Someday, I'll be sure to grasp a hold of what's real

02:21.240 --> 02:23.530
I want to embrace you more

02:23.530 --> 02:26.740
Will you secretly let me see you?

02:26.790 --> 02:29.620
I can't get enough of this dream I'm having!

02:29.620 --> 02:35.000
Be it my heart or also my body, I'll hand them over since it's you.

02:32.830 --> 02:37.590
My heart throbs as I really do love you! (Look here!)

02:38.460 --> 02:43.760
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

02:55.570 --> 02:59.860
"What If Inspiration Academy's Genius Manager..."

03:08.620 --> 03:15.130
Middle School Softball Tournament Championship!

03:13.430 --> 03:15.130
Three outs! That ends the inning!

03:15.590 --> 03:18.380
Another scoreless inning for Nagano.

03:19.060 --> 03:22.860
This is the final game of last year's national
middle-school softball tournament.

03:22.860 --> 03:24.320
On one side, was a very experienced team.

03:24.320 --> 03:27.570
And on the other, a team which had never
made it past the preliminaries.

03:27.570 --> 03:29.480
Which won, do you think?

03:29.480 --> 03:32.400
The experienced team, right?

03:33.290 --> 03:34.900
And that's the game!

03:34.900 --> 03:38.080
In their first appearance,
Sumikawa Middle School wins!

03:38.080 --> 03:39.440
Nope.

03:41.210 --> 03:43.030
And she's their secret.

03:43.030 --> 03:45.120
Who?

03:48.870 --> 03:54.330
The genius manager who can lead any team,
no matter how weak, to victory!

03:54.330 --> 03:55.990
N-Nice to meet you.

03:55.990 --> 03:57.460
I'm Kurabu Katsuyo.

04:01.590 --> 04:04.470
Kurabu Katsuyo

04:02.550 --> 04:04.470
Genius

04:03.090 --> 04:04.470
Manager

04:15.100 --> 04:16.480
Taketo...

04:20.990 --> 04:22.740
Wh-What is this?

04:22.740 --> 04:25.000
Okay, you two have fun!

04:26.090 --> 04:28.340
Ch-Chief!

04:28.340 --> 04:30.440
Welcome to the canned-in room.

04:32.070 --> 04:34.860
You have forty-eight hours left,
no matter what.

04:34.860 --> 04:36.880
You can't miss the deadline again.

04:36.880 --> 04:38.520
So, let the game begin!

04:39.380 --> 04:41.380
But I'm sure it'll be fine.

04:41.380 --> 04:44.430
I believe in you, Akutagawa-sensei.

04:44.430 --> 04:46.640
Let's get to work!

04:48.440 --> 04:50.360
Yeah, I know...

04:50.360 --> 04:52.930
This isn't how literary people work.

04:52.930 --> 04:55.900
I'm sorry. I had the wrong idea...

04:55.900 --> 04:57.900
I'm an idiot!

04:57.900 --> 05:00.640
It's fine. Seriously, it's fine.

05:00.640 --> 05:01.750
That's right.

05:01.750 --> 05:04.270
Just because I'm in a slump,
I can't let myself get down.

05:04.270 --> 05:05.780
Akutagawa-sensei!

05:05.780 --> 05:07.820
I need to put my back into it. Yeah!

05:08.150 --> 05:09.290
That's a relief...

05:09.290 --> 05:11.600
I always work with sports clubs.

05:11.600 --> 05:14.770
This is my first cultural club,
so I was a bit worried.

05:16.210 --> 05:17.760
Akutagawa-sensei...

05:17.760 --> 05:19.500
Let's both do our best!

05:19.500 --> 05:21.290
Stop calling me sensei.

05:22.150 --> 05:23.740
Taketo is fine.

05:23.740 --> 05:26.470
Then you can call me Katsuyo!

05:26.470 --> 05:28.060
All right, Katsuyo-chan.

05:28.060 --> 05:29.970
Thank you!

05:31.050 --> 05:35.390
<i>Well, regardless of how it happened, she's here to support me.</i>

05:35.390 --> 05:38.310
<i>But I'm a bit worried, given that
the chief brought her into this.</i>

05:38.310 --> 05:40.130
Come to your desk.

05:40.770 --> 05:44.240
I prepared paper and writing utensils for you.

05:45.050 --> 05:47.910
If there's anything you need, just ask. Okay?

05:47.910 --> 05:49.870
O-Okay!

05:47.910 --> 05:50.910
Canned Beef

05:53.950 --> 05:56.910
Noon : 2 Hours Have Passed

06:09.340 --> 06:11.930
I'll go change, okay?

06:16.100 --> 06:17.800
<i>Ch-Change?</i>

06:18.550 --> 06:20.860
<i>Then, beyond that door...</i>

06:29.200 --> 06:31.200
Th-This is...

06:33.650 --> 06:35.050
No good. I've got nothing.

06:36.670 --> 06:40.790
Normally, this would be enough for 40 pages.

06:41.600 --> 06:44.960
I've gotta write. I have columns,
short stories, books...

06:44.960 --> 06:46.590
There's no time!

06:46.590 --> 06:49.760
What if I can't write anymore?

06:55.310 --> 06:58.550
L-O-V-E... Akutagawa!

06:58.550 --> 07:02.270
C-U-T-E... Taketo, yay!

07:02.270 --> 07:05.230
I'm happy, but be quiet.

07:06.280 --> 07:08.820
1:00 PM : 3 Hours Have Passed

07:09.590 --> 07:11.320
Did you hear, Onee-sama?

07:11.320 --> 07:12.340
What?

07:12.340 --> 07:14.330
About Akutagawa Taketo.

07:15.490 --> 07:17.900
He's out because he has deadlines, right?

07:17.900 --> 07:22.750
I heard he's in a slump, and he's locked in
somewhere until his work's done.

07:22.750 --> 07:26.350
I like it better with him gone. It's quiet.

07:26.350 --> 07:29.260
But I hope he'll take this chance
to become a normal human being.

07:29.260 --> 07:30.710
Locked up?

07:42.010 --> 07:42.990
<i>All right!</i>

07:42.990 --> 07:46.030
<i>I thought an apron and uniform
was a clichéd trope,</i>

07:46.030 --> 07:48.410
<i>but maybe I should rethink that.</i>

07:48.410 --> 07:49.380
Taketo-kun?

07:49.930 --> 07:53.450
Lunch is almost done. So wait just a bit, okay?

07:55.450 --> 07:57.120
<i>I've got it!</i>

08:04.910 --> 08:06.460
<i>No, I don't...</i>

08:06.460 --> 08:07.960
It's done!

08:07.960 --> 08:09.800
A-Already?

08:09.800 --> 08:11.780
Huh? Was it too soon?

08:11.780 --> 08:13.790
No... Thanks.

08:13.790 --> 08:16.360
I've never eaten a girl's
home-cooked meal before.

08:16.360 --> 08:19.260
Eat a lot, and build up your stamina.

08:19.260 --> 08:19.970
Okay!

08:19.970 --> 08:22.060
Eat it while it's hot.

08:23.480 --> 08:24.990
What is that?!

08:24.990 --> 08:29.480
Katsuyo's special tuna eyeball stew!
It's good brain food!

08:30.480 --> 08:31.990
Eat up!

08:36.990 --> 08:38.420
Taketo-kun?

08:38.420 --> 08:40.240
What's wrong, Taketo-kun?

08:44.620 --> 08:45.960
Katsuyo-kun!

08:45.960 --> 08:47.230
Y-Yes?

08:47.230 --> 08:51.420
What organ of the human body can swell,
up to six times its normal size?

08:52.110 --> 08:53.360
What organ?

08:54.050 --> 08:55.760
Th-The peni—

08:55.760 --> 08:57.100
You fool!

08:57.100 --> 08:59.050
Watch your language!

08:59.050 --> 09:01.200
I-I'm sorry!

09:01.200 --> 09:02.680
The eye!

09:02.680 --> 09:03.130
Huh?

09:03.130 --> 09:04.820
It gets bigger when it's dark...

09:04.820 --> 09:05.850
When it's dark?

09:05.860 --> 09:07.080
Y-Yes!

09:07.080 --> 09:09.200
Then let's check your answer!

09:18.360 --> 09:19.490
Good morning!

09:19.490 --> 09:20.410
Raika?

09:20.410 --> 09:22.700
If you've got time to sleep,
I guess you're doing fine.

09:23.640 --> 09:25.900
Don't you have deadlines to meet?

09:27.220 --> 09:29.960
Oh, man! I slept a long time!

09:29.970 --> 09:31.960
Thank you for waking me!

09:31.960 --> 09:33.470
I need to hurry...

09:33.470 --> 09:34.570
Don't worry about it.

09:34.570 --> 09:39.850
I just came to photograph the
porno author who can't write porno.

09:40.490 --> 09:42.220
Good morning, Taketo-kun!

09:43.020 --> 09:44.480
Kurabu Katsuyo?

09:44.480 --> 09:46.010
Welcome back.

09:46.010 --> 09:47.890
Are you hungry?

09:47.890 --> 09:50.360
Just wait. I'll get dinner ready.

09:50.360 --> 09:51.340
Thanks.

09:51.340 --> 09:52.460
Taketo...

09:52.460 --> 09:55.000
Do you know who she is?

09:55.000 --> 09:56.940
A genius manager, right?

09:56.940 --> 09:59.870
I was told that anyone she helps
will succeed, no matter what.

09:59.870 --> 10:04.130
That's right. Having her on your side
essentially means success.

10:04.130 --> 10:07.620
But that victory always comes with a price.

10:11.880 --> 10:14.880
Here's what ended up happening to
the baseball team with whom she worked.

10:18.260 --> 10:20.870
That's my phone? How...

10:20.870 --> 10:21.730
Yes?

10:22.930 --> 10:27.740
Oh, me? I'm Taketo-san's manager,
Kurabu Katsuyo.

10:28.220 --> 10:29.630
Taketo-san?

10:29.630 --> 10:31.510
One minute...

10:32.840 --> 10:34.370
It's your publisher.

10:35.230 --> 10:37.310
I'm not here! Tell them I'm not here!

10:37.310 --> 10:39.910
He said, "Tell them I'm not here."

10:40.860 --> 10:44.710
I'm very sorry. No, please...
Listen to me!

10:44.710 --> 10:46.400
My PC's having problems...

10:46.400 --> 10:47.980
Oh, I hand write, don't I?

10:47.980 --> 10:50.870
Um, then something happened to a relative...

10:54.880 --> 10:56.770
I got some great photos!

10:56.770 --> 10:58.380
Good luck with your writing.

10:59.130 --> 11:01.360
No more... I can't go on.

11:00.790 --> 11:01.360
Taketo-kun?

11:01.360 --> 11:05.140
I'm a terrible writer! I'm sure that's
what the editor thinks...

11:05.140 --> 11:08.380
That's not true! I know you can do it.

11:08.380 --> 11:09.810
Get back your self-confidence!

11:09.810 --> 11:10.690
That's right!

11:11.400 --> 11:13.370
It's my hand's fault!

11:13.370 --> 11:16.730
I have to write because I have hands!

11:14.470 --> 11:16.730
Wait! T-Taketo-kun, don't!

11:16.730 --> 11:18.400
I have deadlines because I have hands!

11:54.430 --> 11:57.940
I see. She even practices this late.

11:58.480 --> 12:00.910
Maybe I'll try a bit harder.

12:00.910 --> 12:02.950
No!

12:02.960 --> 12:04.950
No, Taketo-kun!

12:06.010 --> 12:08.700
Taketo-kun!

12:23.760 --> 12:26.350
8:00 AM : 22 Hours Have Passed

12:43.390 --> 12:44.490
No way!

12:46.120 --> 12:48.280
You don't have to force yourself to read them.

12:48.280 --> 12:53.050
No! As your manager, I should be
familiar with all your work.

12:54.930 --> 12:56.890
No way... No!

13:00.250 --> 13:02.760
D-Don't!

13:03.620 --> 13:06.760
I didn't think I'd have to listen
to that all night...

13:07.680 --> 13:10.110
Keep going. Do your best...

13:10.110 --> 13:11.470
As hard as you can.

13:11.470 --> 13:14.730
I'm glad she's cheering me on,
even in her dreams...

13:16.040 --> 13:18.760
Oh, I'm sleepy, too.

13:19.270 --> 13:20.020
Taketo!

13:20.020 --> 13:21.580
I heard from Raika

13:21.580 --> 13:24.570
that you were locked in here
with your manager...

13:24.570 --> 13:28.920
Oh, Ritsu. Sorry. Let them know
I won't be in today, okay?

13:30.550 --> 13:33.440
My schedule's really rough...

13:33.440 --> 13:35.000
R-Rough?

13:35.370 --> 13:37.330
Yeah, really rough.

13:37.330 --> 13:39.090
They've been riding me pretty hard.

13:39.250 --> 13:40.840
Riding you hard?

13:39.250 --> 13:40.840
Gan

13:40.840 --> 13:44.390
I-I'm sure with your talent,
you'll be fine. But...

13:44.390 --> 13:45.990
I-I-I...

13:46.730 --> 13:49.180
Ritsu! Recite pi!

13:49.180 --> 13:53.010
3.1415926535...

13:53.010 --> 13:55.790
No... I'm falling asleep..

13:59.940 --> 14:01.440
Katsuyo-kun!

14:01.440 --> 14:02.860
Y-Yes?

14:02.860 --> 14:06.540
Give me the name of a
northern Saskatchewan lake!

14:07.910 --> 14:08.540
O...

14:08.540 --> 14:09.610
Well?

14:09.610 --> 14:11.020
O-Oman...

14:11.020 --> 14:12.120
Louder!

14:12.120 --> 14:14.360
Oman... Lake.

14:14.360 --> 14:15.870
Louder!

14:15.870 --> 14:17.480
Oman Lake!

14:17.480 --> 14:18.750
More passion!

14:18.750 --> 14:20.390
Oman Lake!

14:20.390 --> 14:22.300
Like you're whispering secrets
in your lover's ear!

14:22.300 --> 14:23.700
Oman Lake...

14:23.700 --> 14:25.890
Like you've just had an orgasm!

14:25.890 --> 14:27.840
Oman Lake!

14:27.840 --> 14:30.010
Like when you're drinking coffee at dawn...

14:32.450 --> 14:33.430
What's this?

14:35.430 --> 14:38.440
I'll talk to

14:35.430 --> 14:38.440
the teacher.

14:35.430 --> 14:38.440
Good luck.

14:36.390 --> 14:37.470
Ritsu...

14:38.440 --> 14:39.750
Thanks, Ritsu.

14:39.750 --> 14:41.940
Now then, back to work.

14:42.930 --> 14:43.380
Yes?

14:43.380 --> 14:44.660
Again?!

14:43.380 --> 14:47.270
This is pornographic author
Akutagawa Taketo's phone.

14:47.270 --> 14:49.750
If you're calling regarding anything
other than a deadline extension,

14:49.750 --> 14:52.710
please leave a message after the beep!

14:52.710 --> 14:53.740
Beep!

14:54.640 --> 14:55.880
Perfect!

14:55.880 --> 14:58.300
Don't answer my phone!

14:59.820 --> 15:04.290
I-I'm sorry! I thought that
just because I'm your manager...

15:04.290 --> 15:05.840
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

15:05.840 --> 15:07.980
And one more bonus idiot!

15:07.980 --> 15:09.400
<i>She has problems.</i>

15:09.400 --> 15:11.590
<i>She has serious problems...</i>

15:15.600 --> 15:17.890
Noon : 26 Hours Have Passed

15:17.890 --> 15:19.950
I'm hungry...

15:21.100 --> 15:23.660
Katsuyo-chan? It's open!

15:23.660 --> 15:24.920
Excuse me.

15:25.650 --> 15:26.800
I stopped by.

15:26.800 --> 15:28.320
Utae-san?

15:31.320 --> 15:34.570
I heard it's really hard on authors
when they have a deadline.

15:34.570 --> 15:36.530
So I made you a lunch.

15:36.530 --> 15:38.360
Should I not have?

15:38.360 --> 15:40.740
No, I'm really glad you did!

15:40.740 --> 15:43.330
I was just getting hungry.

15:45.210 --> 15:46.780
Oh, my... I'm embarrassed.

15:46.780 --> 15:49.120
I hurried because I didn't have much time.

15:50.070 --> 15:51.220
Utae-san...

15:51.220 --> 15:54.200
<i>That's right. She's an idol, isn't she?</i>

15:54.200 --> 15:56.490
<i>She's busy, but she still found time for me...</i>

15:58.590 --> 16:01.200
<i>A real boxed lunch, from the
world's most famous idol.</i>

16:01.200 --> 16:03.980
<i>Complete with bandage toppings.</i>

16:04.740 --> 16:06.250
What's wrong?

16:06.250 --> 16:07.440
I'm sorry...

16:07.440 --> 16:11.700
I never knew it was so wonderful
having someone support you...

16:11.700 --> 16:13.580
Y-You're exaggerating, Taketo-kun.

16:13.580 --> 16:14.930
Let's eat.

16:14.930 --> 16:15.910
O-Okay!

16:17.040 --> 16:21.400
You have no time, right?
Keep writing, and I'll feed you.

16:21.400 --> 16:22.950
Say "ahh"!

16:28.900 --> 16:30.160
Ahh...

16:31.080 --> 16:32.730
This is kind of embarrassing.

16:32.730 --> 16:34.170
Y-Yeah.

16:35.590 --> 16:37.640
S-So, how is it?

16:38.350 --> 16:40.160
It's great!

16:40.160 --> 16:41.200
Really?

16:41.200 --> 16:42.780
Really! Really!

16:42.780 --> 16:45.770
It's the best boxed lunch I've ever had!

16:45.770 --> 16:47.610
You're exaggerating.

16:48.050 --> 16:50.750
Good luck with your writing, sensei!

16:50.750 --> 16:52.190
Say "ahh"!

16:52.190 --> 16:53.430
Ahh...

16:54.240 --> 16:57.960
<i>Th-These are definitely her chopsticks.</i>

16:57.960 --> 16:59.870
<i>Wh-Which means...</i>

16:59.870 --> 17:02.270
<i>Her lips were on them.</i>

17:02.270 --> 17:04.920
<i>And they're touching my lips...</i>

17:04.920 --> 17:08.960
<i>So my lips are on hers?</i>

17:09.520 --> 17:12.270
<i>This is incredible!</i>

17:13.470 --> 17:14.850
<i>I can do this!</i>

17:14.850 --> 17:16.640
<i>I can put this passion into my writing...</i>

17:16.640 --> 17:18.650
I'm back...

17:19.370 --> 17:23.150
I'm sorry. One of the sports clubs
wanted my help.

17:23.150 --> 17:25.270
But I'm done now.

17:26.530 --> 17:28.140
What a wonderful lunch!

17:28.140 --> 17:30.180
Who made it?

17:30.180 --> 17:32.750
W-Would you like to join us?

17:32.750 --> 17:34.560
Are you sure?

17:34.560 --> 17:37.160
Thanks. I'm really hungry.

17:37.160 --> 17:47.170
Canned Beef

17:38.480 --> 17:40.120
G-Good luck...

17:40.120 --> 17:41.450
Th-Thanks.

17:41.450 --> 17:43.160
Thanks for lunch!

17:43.160 --> 17:44.130
Bye!

17:54.290 --> 17:57.230
<i>I was so close to getting something...</i>

17:57.230 --> 17:59.970
How is it? Still nothing?

17:59.970 --> 18:02.180
Yeah. Nothing.

18:02.180 --> 18:03.620
But that's okay!

18:03.620 --> 18:07.460
You have twenty hours, so um...
How many per hour...

18:07.460 --> 18:09.560
How many pages do you need to write?

18:09.560 --> 18:13.240
<i>That's it! If you want to entice someone,
you need concealment!</i>

18:13.240 --> 18:15.520
<i>Then, once it's time, a glimpse of exposure!</i>

18:15.520 --> 18:16.890
<i>Everyone knows that!</i>

18:16.890 --> 18:18.030
<i>Concentrate...</i>

18:18.030 --> 18:21.580
<i>This emotion I feel, with all my senses...</i>

18:21.580 --> 18:25.580
<i>I'll be able to put this passion
into my words this time!</i>

18:27.620 --> 18:29.110
You were peeking, weren't you?

18:29.110 --> 18:32.920
N-No! My eyes just moved on their own...

18:32.920 --> 18:35.260
It's for your work, isn't it?

18:35.260 --> 18:38.430
I've read a lot of your books, so I understand.

18:38.430 --> 18:41.950
You need stuff like this for your work, right?

18:41.950 --> 18:43.430
Okay, then...

18:47.160 --> 18:48.940
Bang!

18:49.610 --> 18:53.820
<i>No. That's not it...
That isn't what I need!</i>

18:56.990 --> 18:58.950
9:00 PM : 35 Hours Have Passed

19:03.660 --> 19:08.380
Twelve hours left. How's it coming?
Are you done?

19:08.380 --> 19:09.260
Not at all.

19:09.260 --> 19:12.580
Fine. I guess I have no choice!

19:15.300 --> 19:19.970
From now on, you cannot look away from
your paper, even for a second.

